{"id":184119414,"slug":"navigating-mistrust-in-healthcare","title":"Navigating Mistrust in Healthcare","subtitle":"A new podcast appearance with FINN Voices","post_date":"2026-01-10T13:37:08.733Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/navigating-mistrust-in-healthcare","wordcount":108,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:45:18.519Z","body_sha256":"151114639f4765b1362bff567319b7508cd4830c358e231642cec09210b1e820","text_words":110,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I had the pleasure of connecting with Erica, the host of the FINN voices podcast, at CNS Summit this year.   We hit it off, and she invited me on the show.  I think this may be the most succinct someone has managed to wrangle me to be!</p><p>We talk about the role of trust versus mistrust in healthcare, the virtue of rapid acting treatments for building trust, and why insurance coverage matters, even if healthcare payers are not always the most trusted companies, when bringing new products to market.</p><div class=\"apple-podcast-container\" data-component-name=\"ApplePodcastToDom\"><iframe class=\"apple-podcast \" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/healthcare-now-radio-podcast-network-discussions-on/id1301407966?i=1000743821164&quot;,&quot;isEpisode&quot;:true,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/podcast-episode_1000743821164.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;FINN Voices: Disrupting Mental Health with Data, Trust, and Bold Ideas with Owen Scott Muir MD&quot;,&quot;podcastTitle&quot;:&quot;Healthcare NOW Radio Podcast Network - Discussions on healthcare including technology, innovation, policy, data security, tel&quot;,&quot;podcastByline&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:1711000,&quot;numEpisodes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;targetUrl&quot;:&quot;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/finn-voices-disrupting-mental-health-with-data-trust/id1301407966?i=1000743821164&amp;uo=4&quot;,&quot;releaseDate&quot;:&quot;2026-01-04T00:00:00Z&quot;}\" src=\"https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/healthcare-now-radio-podcast-network-discussions-on/id1301407966?i=1000743821164\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay *; encrypted-media *;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><p>It’s also worth reminding you all that RAMHT happens tomorrow night in San Fran!</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;3736e16d-7c7f-40bc-baab-176fa340a937&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;I'm lucky to have the friends that I have. One of those is Grady Hannah, who gave me a nudge several years back.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:&quot;Read full story&quot;,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Join Us at RAMHT-AI This Sunday in San Fransisco.&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:2277375,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Owen Scott Muir, M.D, DFAACAP&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Dr. Owen Scott Muir, M.D., DFAACAP is the Chief Medical Officer of Radial &amp; Neurolief. He's a graduate of Amherst College, Child, Adolescent, and Adult Psychiatrist, and a prolific writer and podcaster. https://www.meetradial.com for more.&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1c03f44d-4506-4843-989f-0d38e66c6946_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:100}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-01-09T14:00:53.234Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aQm4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F35b5a60c-ca71-428d-9bf1-ca313528ecb7_4027x1088.jpeg&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;